CREATED:20260713T031216Z
DESCRIPTION:Sometimes a dad is also a daddy. And sometimes that daddy is al
 so a Softie. Chicago based comedian\, Tim Felton (Picture the lovechild of 
 Mr. Rogers\, Pee-wee Herman\, and Buster Bluth)\, coming hot off his debut 
 at Chicago's renowned Steppenwolf Theater invites you along in his journey 
 to figure out how to connect with people as he gets older....and softer. Pa
 rt flirting with your barista\, part confiding in your bestie\, Softie expl
 ores the challenges in making and maintaining relationships in an increasin
 gly individualized existence<br><br>Bar opens at 7pm<br>Show at 7:30pm<br>2
 1+<br>$10<br><a href="https://www.bckdoor.com/tickets">Softie Comedy Show T
 ickets</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260713T031318Z
LOCATION:The Back Door\, 207 S College Ave\, Bloomington\, IN 47404\, USA
